Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dog groomers around {City}. {Business Name} has lovely finished grooms on its social pages, but no site where a new owner can see prices by size and coat and request a slot.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a grooming menu priced by size and coat, a matted-coat policy, a first-groom page for puppies and a booking request, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone after your last pick-up?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
